. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cerW1E09E34Q7kNvwFFFxsg&_nc_oc=AdmCuK4pRFjXtr0EKhw0qcVK9V4Y8BKEeiHOihADS3EoArvZw9yXL0Ztp76or44hIxQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsvMoMUvWEO_COEajMojFar5jJGnMt5tASKDyM4JEi_cw&oe=69A438BE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RqBfkUdnO0YQ7kNvwEqnif7&_nc_oc=AdkLlb2Hz9U4Kh2vpsGjVU_4vyQQrxAH_CXcYO_1iLnX2axRtmWvXmrhWSBsPcXv5JI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvYWE0tkbos90EhovfbCbiuaLx72763fVtiOJfIDz7x3w&oe=69A44F5E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lf76i1ig_nwQ7kNvwGqHAcD&_nc_oc=AdlZSROlcc-z1caOCD6MNIGezrrgubhopxomE5PSSNHwSAP77F5qPMs0UxFfy7_ZDOQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftvdlQ8qfGg9bXjhITOe99LUK01c9MPTp5v7_EbKrZfJg&oe=69A444DB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-2